# The OpenCode and Pi versions CARL is tested with (Phase 23.5.1.11). ./setup installs these, not npm's newest, and
# updates an older one to them; a newer one of the same major version stays (the setup says that CARL did not test it).
# OpenCode 2 is a different program for plugins: CARL's OpenCode plugins need OpenCode 1 (Phase 23.7 moves them).
# Read by client/setup and client/install-clients.sh (sourced) and by tools (KEY="VALUE" lines only).
OPENCODE_TESTED="1.19.0"
OPENCODE_MAJOR="1"
PI_TESTED="1.1.0"
PI_MAJOR="1"
